{
  "format": "stock-v1",
  "about": "Shared golden vectors for the stock/cost core (spec 3.6, PRD-15, PRD-16, INV-02, INV-19). Run by license/stock-core.js (server/test/stock-core.test.js) and by core/stock/StockCore.kt (StockCoreVectorsTest). Money = integer minor units (AFN 1/100). Quantity = integer milli. Expected numbers were computed by hand from the rules below, not copied from either engine.",
  "rules": [
    "mulDivRound(a,b,c) = floorDiv(2*a*b + c, 2*c), c > 0: half toward +infinity (Math.round semantics), exact for any 53-bit inputs.",
    "Moving weighted average per (productId, warehouseId): an outbound of q from qty>0 costs mulDivRound(value, q, qty), or the whole value when q == qty.",
    "Shortage (stock goes below zero) is costed at the last known unit cost; with no known cost it is 0 and the review task says unknown_cost.",
    "An inbound with an explicit cost that covers a shortage emits costAdjustMinor = trueCost(covered) - provisionalCost(covered) (append-only cost adjustment).",
    "Inbound without an explicit cost enters at the current average (or last known cost) and never emits a cost adjustment.",
    "Lots only decide FEFO and expiry: order = expiryDate asc (none last), productionDate asc (none last), receipt sequence, lotId. Lot \"\" is stock without a lot; only it can go negative.",
    "Sales skip lots whose expiryDate < today. Local mode refuses an outbound beyond what is available; recorded mode never refuses for stock, takes healthy then expired lots, goes negative and returns a review task.",
    "Identity per position: value = purchases + landed - cogs - waste - supplierReturns + adjustments + transfers + production + revaluation - costAdjust."
  ],
  "mulDivRound": [
    [10, 1, 4, 3],
    [-10, 1, 4, -2],
    [7, 1, 3, 2],
    [-7, 1, 3, -2],
    [5, 1, 3, 2],
    [-5, 1, 3, -2],
    [1, 1, 2, 1],
    [-1, 1, 2, 0],
    [170000, 3000, 15000, 34000],
    [136000, 1000, 12000, 11333],
    [123456789, 987654, 1000, 121932591483],
    [9007199254740991, 1000, 3000, 3002399751580330],
    [9007199254740991, 9007199254740991, 9007199254740991, 9007199254740991],
    [-9007199254740991, 4503599627370496, 9007199254740991, -4503599627370496],
    [4503599627370497, 3, 6, 2251799813685249]
  ],
